ogical behaviours. <span class="Apple-converted-space">  </span>This findings have impacted modern understanding of the role of genetic and environmental influences on behaviour, which can benefit biologists, psychologists and neuroscientists. (64 words)</p><p> </p><p></p><p></p><h2>6.<b>Abstraction (Sign Language)</b> | PTE Summarize Spoken Text (SST)</h2> <audio class="wp-audio-shortcode" id="audio-10478-5" preload="none" style="width: 100%;" controls="controls"><source type="audio/mpeg" src="https://www.ptebank.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Abstraction-Sign-Language.mp3?_=5" /><a href="https://www.ptebank.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Abstraction-Sign-Language.mp3">https://www.ptebank.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Abstraction-Sign-Language.mp3</a></audio><p> </p><p class="p2">So the topic for today is abstraction. And this is a very important layer of computer because you can&#8217;t do anything with a computer unless you have a symbolic system in place. Right. So we&#8217;re talking about the origin of symbolic systems. Language is a classic symbolic system. Apparently one theory for why language evolved is that people communicated with sign language and with movement quite well for a long time. And it turned out that they wanted to communicate even while they were doing things. So, while they were trying to strangle the dinosaur, not the dinosaurs, the rhinoceros, they wanted to say &#8220;Come help me&#8221; and they use sign language to do it. They had to let go of the rhinoceros and the rhinoceros ran away. So you can see that it&#8217;s a good idea to be able to do something with your hands and be able to communicate at the same time. Hence there come words and language</p><p class="p1">The research on genes has provided integrating information, and the findings can benefit biologists, psychologists and neuroscientists.</p><p class="p1">Qualitative research has fostered arguments that behavioural genetics is an ungovernable field without scientific norms or consensus, which fosters controversy.</p><p><b>Abstraction | PTE Summarize Spoken Text (SST) &#8211; Sample Answer:</b></p><p class="p1">The abstraction which also known as description has two methods which are symbolic language and body language. Specifically, the abstraction is important for developing a computer since it originated from the symbolic system. It was created when people tried to communicate with each other by symbolic language. Furthermore, the other part of abstraction is the body language, the physical movement facilitates the development of sign language which became hand words. (70 words)</p><p> </p><p></p><p></p><h1>More Real PTE Questions for February 2023?</h1><p>Get start with signing up with PTE BANK!</p><p><span class="s1"><strong>Step 1: </strong><em><a href="https://www.ptebank.com/my-account/"><span class="s2"><b>Register</b></span></a></em></span><b> </b><span class="s1">an account</span></p><p><a href="https://www.ptebank.com/my-account/"><noscript><img decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-4007" src="https://www.ptebank.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/register.png" alt="PTE Question Bank" width="850" height="500" srcset="https://www.ptebank.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/register.png 1107w, https://www.ptebank.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/register-600x353.png 600w, https://www.ptebank.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/register-768x452.png 768w, https://www.ptebank.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/register-1024x602.png 1024w" sizes="(max-width: 850px) 100vw, 850px" /></noscript><img src='data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%20viewBox=%220%200%20850%20500%22%3E%3C/svg%3E' decoding="async" class="lazyload aligncenter wp-image-4007" data-src="https://www.ptebank.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/register.png" alt="PTE Question Bank" width="850" height="500" data-srcset="https://www.ptebank.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/register.png 1107w, https://www.ptebank.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/register-600x3